  <constraints>
    <constraint source="spec / FR-07 / NFR-07">Assert untouched content — paragraph text, `w14:paraId`, styles, numbering, headers/footers, footnotes, tables (incl. nested) — is preserved across a dirty save. WmlComparer cosmetic re-serialization (BOM/whitespace) is acceptable (Approach A); assert structural/semantic equivalence, not literal byte-identity.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-06 / ADR-038">Through-the-wire `WebApplicationFactory` slice test that POSTs the body the client actually sends through the real save route and asserts the persisted side-effect. Mock ONLY at the `SpeFileStore` facade boundary. NO `Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`, NO DI-registration tests, NO ctor-null tests — these do NOT satisfy the DoD.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038 KEEP path">Place the test under `tests/integration/seam/**` (the vertical-slice-seam KEEP category); follow the existing seam-test fixture conventions.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project / TEST-MODIFYING override">This task modifies `tests/**` → code-review + adr-check run at Step 9.5 UNCONDITIONALLY (overrides any default skip).</constraint>
  </constraints>

